    },
    "?": {},
    "A few words it goes by": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "给它起个名字"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few words, if needed": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "想写几个字也行"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A fresh transcription will replace the transcript you edited. You can restore it afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "重新转写会替换你编辑过的文字记录，之后仍可恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet sign the Ocean received it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "海洋收到时的轻声回应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A soft chime and a gentle swell when a thought is released. The ring/silent switch quiets the chime.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "灵感入海时,一声轻柔的音效,一阵温和的涌动。拨到静音时,音效也随之安静。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Action Button": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作按钮"
          }
        }
      }
    },
