    },
    "Help me grow an idea…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "帮我培育一个灵感…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Help me grow my newest idea": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "帮我培育最新的灵感"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Holds the water still, brightens the words that carry meaning, and widens every touch target. Nothing about your Ocean changes, only how it moves. The system Reduce Motion setting stills the water too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "让水面静止，点亮承载意义的文字，并加大每个可点按区域。海洋本身不会变，变的只是它流动的方式。系统的「减弱动态效果」设置同样会让水面静止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How has my thinking drifted lately?": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "我的思绪最近漂向了何处？"
          }
        }
      }
